750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) DISH AREA - 1. general surfaces of sprayer (splash/buildup), 2. sprayer sink (buildup on underside beneath sink), & 3. 3 part sink (buildup on underside beneath compartments);
B) BACK PREP - 1. bulk powder storage bins (general surfaces with splash/powder buildup), 2. spice storage shelves (underside with splash), 3. rolling cart used for cutting board storage (bottom bracket and slide next to range-top oven with splash). & 4. range-top oven - bottom inside/around door seal and knobs  (splash/buildup);
C) COOK LINE - 1. bottom storage shelf of steam table (crumbs) & 2. plastic tubs used for bread storage on bottom shelf of steam table (crumbs);    and
D) TASTING BAR - extra equipment storage shelf to the left of dish machine and handsink (general buildup).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
